msgid "Metric Configuration [new]"
msgstr "Usanidi wa Kipimo [kipya]"

#: templates.php
msgid "The explanation given to this measurand. This will be shown as legend within exports as well as a tooltip within the presentation of a report itself."
msgstr "Maelezo yaliyotolewa kwa kipimo hiki. Hii itaonyeshwa kama ufunguo ndani ya uhamishaji na pia kama kidokezo ndani ya uwasilishaji wa ripoti yenyewe."

#: templates.php
msgid "Define a unique abbreviation for this measurand with max. 8 letters/numbers."
msgstr "Bainisha ufupisho wa kipekee kwa kipimo hiki wenye herufi/nambari zisizozidi 8."

#: templates.php
msgid "The unit given to this measurand. e.g. 'Bits/s'"
msgstr "Kipimo kilichopewa kigezo hiki kinachopimwa. k.m. 'Bits/s'"

#: templates.php
msgid "Consolidation function"
msgstr "Kazi ya ujumuishaji"

#: templates.php
msgid "The name of the consolidation function to define which CDPs should be read out."
msgstr "Jina la kitendaji cha ujumuishaji ili kufafanua ni CDP zipi zinapaswa kusomwa."

#: templates.php
msgid "Choose 'enable' if this measurand should be become part of the final report output. Leave it unflagged if this measurands will only be used as an auxiliary calculation."
msgstr "Chagua 'enable' ikiwa kipimo hiki kinapaswa kuwa sehemu ya tokeo la mwisho la ripoti. Kiache bila kuwekwa alama ikiwa kipimo hiki kitatumika tu kama hesabu saidizi."

#: templates.php
msgid "Choose 'enable' if this measurand will only have one result in total instead of one for every Data Source Item. It's result<br>will be shown separately. Use this option in combination with \"Visible\" = \"off\" if you are looking for a measurand keeping an interim result only that should be reused within the calculation of other measurands without being visible for end users."
msgstr "Chagua 'enable' ikiwa kipimo hiki kitakuwa na tokeo moja tu kwa jumla badala ya moja kwa kila Kipengee cha Chanzo cha Data. Tokeo lake<br>litaonyeshwa kando. Tumia chaguo hili pamoja na \"Visible\" = \"off\" ikiwa unatafuta kipimo kinachohifadhi tokeo la muda tu ambalo linapaswa kutumika tena ndani ya hesabu ya vipimo vingine bila kuonekana kwa watumiaji wa mwisho."

#: templates.php
msgid "Formatting"
msgstr "Uumbizaji"

#: templates.php
msgid "Defines as what type the data should be treated as."
msgstr "Hubainisha ni kama aina gani data inapaswa kushughulikiwa."

#: templates.php
msgid "Precision"
msgstr "Usahihi"

#: templates.php
msgid "Defines how many decimal digits should be displayed for floating-point numbers."
msgstr "Hubainisha tarakimu ngapi za desimali zinapaswa kuonyeshwa kwa nambari za desimali (floating-point)."

#: templates.php
msgid "Prefixes"
msgstr "Viambishi awali"

#: templates.php
msgid "Choose the type of prefix being used to format the result. With the use of decimal prefixes '1024' will be formatted to '1.024k' while the binary prefixes option returns '1ki'. Select 'off' to display the raw data, here '1024'."
msgstr "Chagua aina ya kiambishi awali kinachotumika kuumbiza matokeo. Kwa kutumia viambishi awali vya desimali '1024' itaumbizwa kuwa '1.024k' ilhali chaguo la viambishi awali vya jozi hurejesha '1ki'. Chagua 'off' ili kuonyesha data ghafi, hapa '1024'."

#: templates.php
msgid "Formula"
msgstr "Fomula"

#: templates.php
msgid "The mathematical definition of this measurand. Allowed are all combinations of operators and operands listed below following the rules of mathematics. Use round and square brackets to signify complex terms and the order of operations."
msgstr "Ufafanuzi wa kihisabati wa kipimo hiki. Zinazoruhusiwa ni michanganyiko yote ya viendeshaji na vipengele vilivyoorodheshwa hapa chini kwa kufuata kanuni za hisabati. Tumia mabano ya mviringo na ya mraba kuashiria istilahi changamano na mpangilio wa utendaji."

#: templates.php
msgid "Operators & Operands"
msgstr "Viendeshaji na Viendeshwa"

#: templates.php
msgid "Click on one of the listed operators or operand to append them to your calucalion formula. The tooltip will show you additional information like description, return value, arguments and usage."
msgstr "Bofya mojawapo ya viendeshaji au viendeshwa vilivyoorodheshwa ili kuviongeza kwenye fomula yako ya kukokotoa. Kidokezo cha zana kitakuonyesha maelezo ya ziada kama vile maelezo, thamani ya kurejesha, hoja na matumizi."

